# Apptainer definition file for GeoCoT environment.
#
# BUILDTIME: Rocky Linux 9 base OS only (Bootstrap:yum).
#   No %post section = no device creation = no fakeroot issues.
# RUNTIME: Job script installs Python + CUDA + packages on compute node.
#
# The job script (scripts/run.sh) handles all runtime installation:
#   - Installs CUDA from NVIDIA's Ubuntu 24.04 repo (apt at runtime)
#   - Uses /dev/shm/pylib for Python packages
#   - Mounts GPFS data and models from /home/user/

Bootstrap: yum
From: https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/9/BaseOS/x86_64/os
